        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551076802-e277f87ed6f1?w=900&h=350&fit=crop" alt="5G Telemedicine Surgery" onerror="this.src='https://picsum.photos/900/350?random=15'" />
        <p class="image-caption">الجراحة عن بُعد - روبوتات، Haptic Feedback، و URLLC</p>
